{"4663930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SYLVA", "steam_appid": 4663930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYLVA – Survive, Fight, Dominate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deserted island… A forgotten civilization… And enemies reduced to mere bones, yet still fighting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYLVA throws you into the heart of a brutal struggle for survival. You are not alone on this island. Skeleton warriors wielding swords and bows become even more deadly at night. Every step is a risk, every decision your chance at survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔸 Open World Survival: A vast island and dangerous zones await you to explore.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔸 Intense Combat System: Rely on your reflexes, from close combat to ranged battles. Your enemies are not simple—they are hunting you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔸 Advanced RPG Mechanics: Develop your character, choose your skills, and create your own play style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔸 Base Building and Defense: Build, strengthen, and defend your own base against attacks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔸 Day-Night Cycle: When the sun sets, the rules change. Watch out for meteors after midnight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔸Every 7th day eclipse makes the dead more active.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔸Raids and Battles: If you enter unprepared, you won't return. This island is merciless. Here, the survivors... rule.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYLVA – Can you survive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYLVA – Survive, Fight, Dominate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deserted island… A forgotten civilization… And enemies re